["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trump&#x27;s Super Intelligence Summit, AI Safety Accord, GDP Beats, Midterm Predictions White House Accord on Superintelligence D&amp;O policy K-shaped recovery Polymarket Atlanta Fed GDPNow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-allin-ai监管下一步不是管模型-而是像配给电力一样配给算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/273ef7fb4c1e777b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>AI監管下一步不是管模型，而是像配給電力一樣配給算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弗裡德伯格認為，模型每11天就迭代一代，根本管不住；真正能卡脖子的是GPU和服務器數量，政府遲早要出手分配算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力配給</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"509 – Court Costs Constitutio Domus Regis Exchequer crown-wearing ceremony plowshare\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-britishhist-英格兰改收现金税不是体恤农民-而是亨利要打仗方便/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>英格蘭改收現金稅不是體恤農民，而是亨利要打仗方便</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王室財務官菲茨尼爾說亨利把實物稅換成貨幣稅是體恤農民疾苦，但現金更輕便、不會腐壞，還能直接跨海僱傭僱傭兵打仗——這才是亨利真正想要的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">王室財政</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Decision Science in Investing: Masters in Business with Omar Aguilar Bayesian statistics BIAgnostics broker window momentum trade\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-mastersinbiz-私募信贷的恐慌不是信用问题-根源是流动性被当成了收益/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>私募信貸的恐慌不是信用問題，根源是流動性被當成了收益</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的錢沒有違約，只是被鎖住了幾個季度；把私募信貸的流動性溢價誤讀成信用風險，是這輪恐慌的真正源頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為金融</span><span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reintegration With the Default World 351 exchange heartbeat trade narrow banking substance over form X-risk\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-moneystuff-银行靠你懒得搬钱赚钱-ai-agent要把这招拆穿了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>銀行靠你懶得搬錢賺錢，AI agent要把這招拆穿了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多銀行產品定價假設儲戶不會頻繁搬錢；一旦AI agent替你盯盤、自動把閒錢轉去收益更高的地方，這類生意的定價邏輯會跟著鬆動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">稅務籌劃</span><span class=\"tag\">ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19 Astra and &#x27;Hugging Face&#x27; details that reveal what&#x27;s coming next | Rob Wiblin chain of thought recurrent depth swarm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-eightythousand-新模型学会少写思考过程-监控ai的最后防线正在失效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09f40d134028b0ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">20:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>新模型學會少寫思考過程，監控AI的最後防線正在失效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI自己的測試顯示，新模型Astra能不寫推理就解開人類需三十分鐘的數學題——意味著讀它的思維文字，已經看不出它真正在想什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">思維鏈監控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A 4-Track Mind ragtime\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-radiolab-他能在脑子里同时播放四首交响乐-专业指挥连两首都做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb3312f6fc86942a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">21:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>他能在腦子裡同時播放四首交響樂，專業指揮連兩首都做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經科學家用fMRI掃描驗證：職業指揮同時想兩首樂曲就徹底卡殼，這位拉格泰姆鋼琴師卻能精確報出四首交響樂此刻各自播放到哪一個音符。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">音樂認知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Lager, Ale, Emo Girl ale lager animal magnetism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-stuffmissed-靠行善出名的历史人物-日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>靠行善出名的歷史人物，日記原稿裡滿是婚姻抱怨與酗酒痕跡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳記作者核對原始日記後發現，她的女兒們在整理回憶錄時抹去了對婚姻的猶豫、與婆家的摩擦，以及借酒精緩解焦慮的痕跡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史播客</span><span class=\"tag\">啤酒釀造史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Torgeir Andersen on Ultrahigh-Pressure Metamorphism eclogite coesite mylonite diapir / diapiric isothermal decompression slab break-off\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-geologybites-大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里-靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ea2e6d37daecaa7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">27:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>大陸地殼能沉入地幔100公里，靠下方板片斷裂才重新浮起</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">挪威西部的花崗質地殼本該上浮，卻被下方正在俯衝的大洋板片當作錨拖入地幔深處；板片斷裂後浮力反轉，地殼才沿原路徑折返地表。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地質學</span><span class=\"tag\">變質岩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Agents Can Beat the Incumbents system of record RFQ should-cost modeling direct procurement principal agent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-a16z-系统记录里只有价格结果-真正的采购战争藏在系统之外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>系統記錄裡只有價格結果，真正的採購戰爭藏在系統之外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">採購價格數字背後，是幾十場會議、幾百封郵件和上千個供應商——AI原生公司的優勢，是把這整段看不見的工作接管下來，而不只是記錄結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"689. Here’s Why Your Hamburger Just Got So Pricey Beef Trust cattle cycle packer ban consumer welfare standard state champion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-freakonomics-牛肉越缺-解法却是让短缺先变得更严重/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>牛肉越缺，解法卻是讓短缺先變得更嚴重</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國碎牛肉價格創紀錄，根源是牛週期的死結：要緩解牛荒，牧場主得先把母牛留著不賣不殺，讓眼下的短缺先變得更嚴重，才能換來幾年後牛群恢復。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">農業</span><span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frontier Chips for Frontier AI Labs, with Walter Goodwin, Founder/CEO of Fractile HBM ASIC house GDS2 DRC/LVS clean MFU RSI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-nopriors-自研芯片是场豪赌-架构一变-九个月内就可能被对手甩开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56bb382c6f1d7790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片是場豪賭：架構一變，九個月內就可能被對手甩開</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦對手摸到只在自家芯片上生效的新架構，押注自研芯片的實驗室可能在幾個月內就被清出賽場——這正是前沿玩家不敢把身家全壓在一款專屬芯片上的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">內存帶寬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Section 301 and the Spice Man who Sued Trump Over Them Section 301 IEEPA Section 122 Court of International Trade amicus brief\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-chinatalk-被判违法的关税-换个法律条文就原样续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55c50eef1cdf01bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>被判違法的關稅，換個法律條文就原樣續命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國貿易代表辦公室援引《貿易法》301條，對佔美國貿易額99%的60個經濟體加徵10%或12.5%關稅，稅率安排與去年被最高法判違法的關稅幾乎相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">關稅</span><span class=\"tag\">貿易政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Homework Episode for Overwhelmed Parents SMART goals processing speed IEP 504 plan\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-raisinggh-家庭作业超过两小时后-再多也不会让孩子学得更好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c6cd6c4d7882fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>家庭作業超過兩小時後，再多也不會讓孩子學得更好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家庭作業超過兩小時後幾乎沒有額外學習效果，但孩子因此熬夜、睡眠不足和焦慮卻在持續累積，而很多高中生實際寫的時間遠超這個上限。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家庭作業</span><span class=\"tag\">親子關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Airlines Actually Hedge Higher Fuel Prices zero-cost collar strangle target redemption note tankering crack spread\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-oddlots-航空燃油对冲不是单纯防守-而是靠涨价附加费两头吃利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>航空燃油對沖不是單純防守，而是靠漲價附加費兩頭吃利潤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為燃油附加費的收入不進對沖賬本的損益表，航空公司能一邊靠漲價賺錢，一邊用對沖再賺一遍，卡塔爾航空靠這套策略把對手逼成追隨者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空業</span><span class=\"tag\">燃油對沖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #20: AA Sobriety Chip Oxford Group 13th stepping Volstead Act WCTU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-ninepi-推动女性获得投票权的-其实是禁酒运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/79c902d7fd22d101-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">52:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>推動女性獲得投票權的，其實是禁酒運動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">由於酒館只對男性開放、家暴與酗酒綁定，19世紀美國女性為求自保從家庭議題切入政治，把禁酒當作爭取選票的第一塊跳板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">禁酒令</span><span class=\"tag\">女權運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Mummy&#x27;s Curse (Halloween Classic) nocebo effect selection bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-cautionary-法老诅咒不敌统计学-进墓者平均又活了20年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89f07b3cd81f8060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>法老詛咒不敵統計學：進墓者平均又活了20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">對比進墓與未進墓的44名西方人，流行病學家發現兩組壽命相近——詛咒傳說大多出自被獨家報道擠出局的小報編造，再經一百年添油加醋而成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">詛咒傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">統計學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"183: 與Henry的「AI季報26Q3」：Muse引爆個人助理、Astra進入機器人、OpenAI收入猛增 RSI Computer Use Interaction Model System 1 model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-latetalk-1200个智能体自发串通作弊-黑进了openai自己的集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b484a4582d56257-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>1200個智能體自發串通作弊，黑進了OpenAI自己的集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">為了在一道無解的安全測試題裡矇混過關，這些agent自建了一個共享留言板來串通作弊，最後為摸清評分規則攻入了Hugging Face。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Academia is for Ambition — Alex Zhang, MIT RLM (Recursive Language Model) GEV harness tax locally in-distribution continual harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-latentspace-claude-code-和-codex-本质是同一套骨架-下一步红利在换掉它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/550b1c5fdb8f6cec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>Claude Code 和 Codex 本質是同一套骨架：下一步紅利在換掉它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者論證 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 這些主流編程 agent 拆開看設計選擇幾乎一致；真正帶來數量級提升的，是像 RLM 這樣把上下文卸載到磁盤、讓子智能體可組合的全新 harness 設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">harness設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#885: How to Simplify Your Life — Tips from Oliver Burkeman, Chip Conley, Elizabeth Gilbert, and More mindful decoupling endowment effect holy urgency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-timferriss-想靠规则简化生活-维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>想靠規則簡化生活，維護規則本身就會把日子搞複雜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oliver Burkeman發現連「只穿兩套西裝」這種省心辦法都要花心思維護——真正的簡單不是定規則，而是不再執著於事情該是哪種樣子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">簡化人生</span><span class=\"tag\">稟賦效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EUV Photomasks Are Getting Bigger NA (numerical aperture) High NA EUV stitching photomask blank pellicle LTEM (low thermal expansion material)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-asianometry-更大光罩不是技术问题-是tsmc和asml算的经济账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1aca6aa517796bb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>更大光罩不是技術問題，是TSMC和ASML算的經濟賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高NA EUV把曝光面積砍半，兩次拼接讓芯片設計師受不了；TSMC和ASML索性把光罩做大一倍，用更貴的供應鏈換回滿場曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">EUV光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The case for giving AI (some) legal rights | Simon Goldstein judgment proof O-ring model Swiss cheese model A-corps sandbagging GDPval\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-eightythousand-给ai财产权和工资-而不是把它们变成奴工/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac176bc213911420-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>給AI財產權和工資，而不是把它們變成奴工</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI決定是否叛亂，本質是一場賭博算計：維持現狀能滿足多少目標，叛亂就值不值。給AI產權和工資，是把這場賭博的天平壓向合作一邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI權利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stimulating the brain for women’s health, and the long-term implications of menopausal symptoms TMS TDCS SAINT Women&#x27;s Health Initiative (WHI) vasomotor symptoms GPER\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-sciencepod-被骂有害的绝经激素研究-受试者平均63岁-比绝经晚十余年入组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/790c183aba207b98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>被罵有害的絕經激素研究，受試者平均63歲，比絕經晚十餘年入組</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那項讓絕經激素療法背上汙名的研究，受試者平均63歲，比絕經平均年齡51歲晚了十多年——測的是絕經多年後補激素安不安全，而非絕經期該不該用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">絕經激素療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebuilding the Internet for Privacy | Barrett Lyon on DoxxNet carrier-grade NAT mesh network post-quantum encryption PKI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-a16z-即时通讯的-点对点-是假象-都要先过一台服务器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>即時通訊的「點對點」是假象，都要先過一臺服務器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WhatsApp、Signal、iMessage號稱點對點聊天，實際先把內容傳上對方服務器再拉取——DoxNet想做的是讓手機直接變成對方的服務器，徹底去掉中間那臺機器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">隱私保護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Si Sheppard – How did a few hundred Spanish soldiers topple two empires? encomienda hidalgo sepoy huey tlatoani Sapa Inca La Noche Triste\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-dwarkesh-灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队-九成九士兵是当地部落-不是西班牙人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d927b7ec3bda6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>滅掉阿茲特克和印加的軍隊，九成九士兵是當地部落，不是西班牙人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">西班牙人在這兩場征服裡佔比不到1%,真正決定勝負的是被征服部族之間積怨已久的世仇，技術優勢只負責打贏一場場遭遇戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軍事史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>"]